      "signpost": null,
      "definition": "in addition to someone or something",
      "explanation": "In negative sentences and questions, **besides** means *other than* or *apart from* (*nobody besides me*; *who else besides Kim?*). Before a verb it takes the **-ing** form (*besides cooking*).",
